From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Creeeeger <104427569+Creeeeger@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Pin the compatible AuthFramework release

Galaxy Store updates replace the system APK and remove the stock SKPM
compatibility changes. Reserve the highest signed version code for the ROM
build so ordinary store updates cannot replace it. Keep the Samsung release
name and the internal BuildConfig version used by Samsung services intact.
Future AuthFramework upgrades are delivered with their compatibility patches
in ROM updates, using the same reserved version code.

Signed-off-by: Creeeeger <104427569+Creeeeger@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/apktool.yml b/apktool.yml
--- a/apktool.yml
+++ b/apktool.yml
@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@
 packageInfo:
   forcedPackageId: 127
 versionInfo:
-  versionCode: 521003000
+  versionCode: 2147483647
   versionName: 5.2.10.3
 doNotCompress:
 - arsc
